2) REFLEXIVE 
kill(all)$
A:makelist(k,k,1,4)$
R1:[[1,1],[1,2],[2,1],[2,2],[3,4],[4,1],[4,4]]$

checkReflexive(A,R):=block(
 [s:0],
 for i:1 thru length(A) do(
  if member([A[i],A[i]],R)=true then s:s+1
 ),
 if s=length(A) then return("reflexive")
 else return("Not reflexive")
)$
checkReflexive(A,R1)$

